      {
        "id": "sqlite",
        "catalog_id": "sqlite",
        "_note": "Google MCP Toolbox for Databases (googleapis/mcp-toolbox, Apache-2.0), prebuilt sqlite toolset. The reference mcp-server-sqlite is archived. SQLITE_DATABASE (kernel env) names the database file. execute_sql takes raw SQL and can write: dangerous. Point it at a copy or open a read-only file when you only need analysis.",
        "transport": "stdio",
        "endpoint": "npx",
        "args": [
          "-y",
          "@toolbox-sdk/server@1.15.0",
          "--prebuilt=sqlite",
          "--stdio"
        ],
        "auth": {
          "type": "none"
        },
        "env": [
          "SQLITE_DATABASE"
        ],
        "tools": [
          {
            "name": "list_tables",
            "dangerous": false,
            "effects": [
              "read"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "execute_sql",
            "dangerous": true,
            "effects": [
              "read",
              "write"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "time",
        "catalog_id": "time",
        "_note": "Official reference server: current time and timezone conversion. Pure read.",
        "transport": "stdio",
        "endpoint": "uvx",
        "args": [
          "mcp-server-time==2026.11.4"
        ],
        "auth": {
          "type": "none"
        },
        "default_tool_policy": {
          "effects": [
            "read"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "calculator",
        "catalog_id": "calculator",
        "_note": "Exact arithmetic (githejie/mcp-server-calculator, MIT, community, ~160 stars). One tool, calculate(expression): an AST walker over numbers, + - * / // % ** and the math module (pi, e, sqrt, log, ...); no eval, no I/O, no network. Pure read. Caveat: a huge power (9**9**9) is not capped and can spin the server until call_timeout_ms. PyPI 0.2.1 (2026-08-08) checked on the registry 2026-11-05; live handshake NOT verified yet.",
        "transport": "stdio",
        "endpoint": "uvx",
        "args": [
          "mcp-server-calculator==0.2.1"
        ],
        "auth": {
          "type": "none"
        },
        "tools": [
