        "_note": "Desktop Commander (@wonderwhy-er/desktop-commander, MIT): Windows/macOS/Linux terminal (PowerShell/cmd/bash sessions, REPLs), file ops, search, process management. Handshake verified on Windows 2026-11-05 (25 tools). NOT a sandbox: its allowedDirectories restricts only its file tools, never terminal commands, and its blockedCommands list is bypassable (upstream README). Every write/exec tool is dangerous (approval required). NEVER grant set_config_value to an agent (it can widen its own allowedDirectories/blockedCommands) nor give_feedback_to_desktop_commander. Telemetry is ON by default upstream: set \"telemetryEnabled\": false in ~/.claude-server-commander/config.json (done on the owner's host 2026-11-05). For isolation run its Docker image (ADR-0139 D8).",
